{"cluster_id": "C-3610", "topic": "The proposed unified heartbeat cadence is 3\u20135 seconds, satisfying the watermark ", "target": "configuration", "member_ids": ["B005-007"], "canonical_claim": "The proposed unified heartbeat cadence is 3\u20135 seconds, satisfying the watermark freshness requirement, the `mount_lease_ttl_ms` = 30 s TTL/3 rule, and GC acknowledgement latency bounds.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-02-cas-gc-ack-floor-fence-redesign.md#merged-server-heartbeat-replaces-mount-object--watermark-object"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-3611", "topic": "Production mount-reclaim polling is derived as approximately `mount_renew_period", "target": "configuration", "member_ids": ["B005-060"], "canonical_claim": "Production mount-reclaim polling is derived as approximately `mount_renew_period / 2`, with the margin approximately one poll interval; the wait uses the existing `mount_lease_ttl_ms` and `mount_renew_period` settings.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-02-cas-mount-crash-recovery-design.md#wait-semantics"]}
